ubject to be present at your operation: A caregiver without an active eligible background check was present in a 3-5 year old classroom. Note: The operation sent the caregiver home and submitted a background check for the caregiver.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026527901","violation_type_title":"AP Background check results - Must receive notification prior to allowing subject to be present at your operation (26 TAC §745.641)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20250731","date":"2025-07-31","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905760146","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905760146","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2025-07-31","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20250717","date":"2025-07-17","inspection_type":"Investigation of a report","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":1,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905906837","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905906837","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2025-07-17","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20250717-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-a-14","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20250717","date":"2025-07-17","original_code":"746.501(a)(14)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-09-15","finding":"Written Operational Policies - Transportation: The operation has a strong written transportation emergency preparedness plan which includes procedures for restroom emergencies while in transport. However, the policies were not followed as there were no planned restroom stops for a field trip that was about an hour and a half drive away. The policies also were not followed when a child urgently had to go to the bathroom. While information gathered in the investigation indicated staff could not pull over at the time due to stand still traffic, they also did not follow their policies by pulling over when they safely could as the child ended up going on the bus as they were unable to hold it. While the parents were notified of the incident and all parents notified of arrival at the center being delayed from the field trip due to traffic, the director was not notified immediately of the restroom emergency by staff which is in their policies.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026683779","violation_type_title":"Written Operational Policies - Transportation (26 TAC §746.501(a)(14))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20241113","date":"2024-11-13","inspection_type":"Investigation of a report","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":1,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905906836","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905906836","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2024-11-13","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20241113-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-307-c","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20241113","date":"2024-11-13","original_code":"746.307(c)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-12-18","finding":"Parental Notification of Less Serious Injuries: Information from the DFPS investigation indicated a parent was not notified until the next day about an injury in care that occurred.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026585429","violation_type_title":"Parental Notification of Less Serious Injuries (26 TAC §746.307(c))","topic_label":"Safety hazards"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20241021","date":"2024-10-21","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905760145","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905760145","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2024-10-21","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20240819","date":"2024-08-19","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905760144","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905760144","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2024-08-19","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20240614","date":"2024-06-14","inspection_type":"Investigation of a report","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905906835","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905906835","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2024-06-14","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20240605","date":"2024-06-05","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":1,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905760143","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905760143","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2024-06-05","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20240605-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3401-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1519